            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice %@ is installed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice could not speak: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glas nije mogao govoriti: %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice could not speak: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice is downloaded from the MBROLA voices repository on GitHub after you accept its license.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glas se preuzima iz repozitorija glasova MBROLA na GitHubu nakon što prihvatite njegovu licencu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice is downloaded from the MBROLA voices repository on GitHub after you accept its license."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voices are not part of MBROLA NG or of the MBROLA synthesizer. Each voice belongs to those who created it and has its own license, which is shown before you download the voice and on the voice's page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glasovi nisu dio softvera MBROLA NG ni sintetizatora MBROLA. Svaki glas pripada onima koji su ga izradili i ima svoju licencu, koja se prikazuje prije preuzimanja glasa i na stranici glasa."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voices are not part of MBROLA NG or of the MBROLA synthesizer. Each voice belongs to those who created it and has its own license, which is shown before you download the voice and on the voice's page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings apply wherever the voice speaks. The speed, pitch and volume chosen in VoiceOver or in an app are applied on top of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ove postavke vrijede gdje god glas govori. Brzina, visina i glasnoća odabrane u VoiceOveru ili u aplikaciji primjenjuju se povrh njih."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These settings apply wherever the voice speaks. The speed, pitch and volume chosen in VoiceOver or in an app are applied on top of them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app and its speech extension: Hrvoje Katić. GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ova aplikacija i njezino proširenje za govor: Hrvoje Katić. GNU General Public License, verzija 2 ili novija."
          }
        },
